om/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T09:28:42Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T09:28:42Z","body":"I think the SCU code should be adapted if it can't deal with an explicit list of files. CC @lawnjelly ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461731618/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461743463","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98853#issuecomment-2461743463","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98853","id":2461743463,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Suzln","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T09:34:27Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T09:35:08Z","body":"> I think the SCU code should be adapted if it can't deal with an explicit list of files\r\n\r\nIn general it is exactly what I am doing now ;) All my recent PR's are puzzles of a big net of new *fixed* SCU which can normally work with SCons paths, wildcards (already implemented and works almost good), multiple dirs (already in codebase but broken), subdir merging and explicit lists. Tbh I wanted to leave explicit lists for the end and didn't expect this PR to be merged but hoped to leave for the end. OK I will reorder my plans. I think I can do everything about it myself","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461743463/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461754476","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98853#issuecomment-2461754476","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98853","id":2461754476,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Su2Rs","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T09:39:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T09:40:29Z","body":"> I think the SCU code should be adapted if it can't deal with an explicit list of files\r\n\r\nThe reason why it works only with wildcards is very simple. If you process a folder it is very easy to generate header which includes all `*.cpp` files (which isn't so IIRC and generates SCU files more granularly). But if you allow SCU only for wildcarded paths you ensure that there is no any errors or problems... It also performes role of filter which doesn't allow to include files twice\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461754476/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495872890","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98853#issuecomment-2495872890","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98853","id":2495872890,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Uw_96","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-24T08:36:29Z","updated_at":"2024-11-24T08:36:29Z","body":"Was a test field. The change of allowing SCons `#` paths inside arrays is not perfect. I don't want to polish it. If you really need it you can extract it but I doubt it is so necessary","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495872890/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]